<rml>
<head>
	<!-- The character window (uicharacter.py CharacterWindow, uiscript
	     characterwindow.py; P15 spec 4): the status, skill, emotion and
	     quest tabs. While the character flag is on, the Interface makes
	     nui_character.CharacterWindow (controller
	     assets/root/nui_character.py), a subclass of the legacy class whose
	     widgets are proxies: every flow, packet and rule is legacy's code,
	     and this document shows what legacy's refreshes tell the proxies.
	     It loads at the window's first show and is kept, hidden, after it
	     (nui_hud.KeptBoard, P15 V-2b, every panel list empty then), and one
	     tab's panel at a time (each panel_<tab> list holds one entry for the
	     shown tab, none for the others), since RmlUi updates every element
	     of a loaded document each frame. The grids' cells are the legacy
	     slot windows' (the active skills in the uiscript's slot order, the
	     support skills from 101, the solo and mutual emotions, the quest
	     icons), their lengths from the limits module; their events reach the
	     legacy handlers through nui_slots.LegacySlotEvents. A skill cell's
	     plus button lies beside the cell, over its corner (legacy's
	     CSlotButton). The quest clocks are nui-countdown runs (no Python per
	     second). The status labels are text in the modern skins and the
	     locale's label art in classic (art, from the controller). The body
	     and its controls take no focus, so controls act on a left
	     mousedown. It draws below the legacy UI layer, as legacy's window
	     lived in it. A left or right press anywhere on it raises the window
	     (board_press), as legacy's window manager raised the window under a
	     press. -->
	<title>character</title>
	<link type="text/template" href="../../nui.rtpl"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="character.rcss"/>
</head>
<body template="nui" id="character" class="nui-window nui-fx nui-anim nui-below-legacy-ui char" data-model="character"
      data-event-mousedown="board_press(ev.button)" data-class-char--placed="placed" data-class-char--guild="has_guild"
      data-class-char--status="tab == 'STATUS'" data-class-char--skill="tab == 'SKILL'"
      data-class-char--emoticon="tab == 'EMOTICON'" data-class-char--quest="tab == 'QUEST'">
	<div class="nui-window__titlebar char__titlebar">
		<handle id="char-title" class="nui-window__handle char__handle" move_target="#document">
			<span class="nui-window__title char__title" data-if="tab == 'STATUS'">@ui.CHARACTER_MAIN</span>
			<span class="nui-window__title char__title" data-if="tab == 'SKILL'">@ui.CHARACTER_SKILL</span>
			<span class="nui-window__title char__title" data-if="tab == 'EMOTICON'">@ui.CHARACTER_ACTION</span>
			<span class="nui-window__title char__title" data-if="tab == 'QUEST'">@ui.CHARACTER_QUEST</span>
		</handle>
		<button id="char-close" class="nui-button nui-button--ghost nui-button--icon nui-window__close nui-anim char__close"
		        data-event-mousedown="close_press(ev.button)"><span class="nui-glyph nui-glyph--close"><span
			class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span class="nui-glyph__b"></span></span></button>
	</div>
	<div class="nui-window__body char__body">

		<!-- The status page (uiscript Character_Page). -->
		<div class="char-panel char-panel--status" data-for="p : panel_status">
			<!-- The modern looks: the face in a ring with the level on it, the
			     class and the guild as chips, then the level, EXP and the EXP
			     still needed over the bar of the level's progress (EXP over
			     the sum of the two; the texts are legacy's numbers). -->
			<div class="char-head">
				<div id="char-face" class="char-face nui-fx"><div class="char-face__clip"><img class="char-face__image" data-if="face != ''"
					data-attr-src="face"/></div><span class="char-face__level">{{ level }}</span></div>
				<div class="char-who">
					<div id="char-name" class="char-name" data-event-mouseover="name_over()" data-event-mouseout="name_out()"><span
						class="char-name__text">{{ name }}</span></div>
					<div class="char-who__line">
						<div class="char-tag char-tag--job" data-if="job != ''"><span class="char-ico char-ico--job"></span><span
							class="char-tag__text">{{ job }}</span></div>
						<div id="char-guild" class="char-guild" data-if="has_guild"><span class="char-ico char-ico--guild"></span><span
							class="char-guild__text">{{ guild }}</span></div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="char-progress">
				<div class="char-progress__cells">
					<div id="char-level" class="char-chip char-chip--level"><img class="char-art char-art--level" data-attr-src="art.level"/><span
						class="char-chip__label">@ui.CHARACTER_LEVEL</span><span id="char-value-level" class="char-chip__value">{{ level }}</span></div>
					<div id="char-exp" class="char-chip char-chip--exp"><img class="char-art char-art--exp" data-attr-src="art.cur_exp"/><span
						class="char-chip__label">@ui.CHARACTER_EXP</span><span class="char-chip__value">{{ exp }}</span></div>
					<div id="char-exp-rest" class="char-chip char-chip--rest"><img class="char-art char-art--rest" data-attr-src="art.last_exp"/><span
						class="char-chip__label">@ui.CHARACTER_EXP_REST</span><span class="char-chip__value">{{ exp_rest }}</span></div>
				</div>
				<div class="char-exp">
					<progress class="nui-gauge nui-gauge--pink char-exp__bar" direction="right"
					          data-attr-value="exp * 1 + exp_rest * 1 &gt; 0 ? exp / (exp * 1 + exp_rest * 1) : 0"/>
					<div class="char-exp__ticks"></div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="char-divider char-divider--base">
				<div class="char-bar"></div>
				<img class="char-art char-art--std" data-attr-src="art.std"/>
				<span class="char-divider__label">@ui.CHARACTER_BASE_STATS</span>
				<div id="char-stat-points" class="char-points char-points--stat" data-if="stat_points_shown"><img
					class="char-art char-art--uppt" data-attr-src="art.uppt"/><span class="char-points__label">@ui.CHARACTER_POINTS</span><span
					class="char-points__value">{{ stat_points }}</span></div>
			</div>
			<div class="char-base">
				<img class="char-art char-art--std1" data-attr-src="art.std_item1"/>
				<img class="char-art char-art--std2" data-attr-src="art.std_item2"/>
				<div class="char-stats char-stats--base">
					<div class="char-stat char-stat--ht">
						<span class="char-stat__label"><span class="char-ico char-ico--vit"></span>@ui.CHARACTER_VIT</span>
						<span id="char-value-ht" class="char-stat__value">{{ ht }}</span>
						<div class="char-steps">
							<button id="char-minus-ht" class="nui-button nui-button--icon nui-anim char-step char-step--minus" data-if="minus_ht"
							        data-event-mousedown="stat_minus('HTH', ev.button)" data-event-mouseover="stat_over('minus', 'HTH')"
							        data-event-mouseout="stat_out('minus', 'HTH')"><span class="nui-glyph nui-glyph--minus"><span
								class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span class="nui-glyph__b"></span></span></button>
							<button id="char-plus-ht" class="nui-button nui-button--icon nui-anim char-step char-step--plus" data-if="plus_ht"
							        data-event-mousedown="stat_plus('HTH', ev.button)" data-event-mouseover="stat_over('plus', 'HTH')"
							        data-event-mouseout="stat_out('plus', 'HTH')"><span class="nui-glyph nui-glyph--plus"><span
								class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span class="nui-glyph__b"></span></span></button>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="char-stat char-stat--iq">
						<span class="char-stat__label"><span class="char-ico char-ico--int"></span>@ui.CHARACTER_INT</span>
						<span id="char-value-iq" class="char-stat__value">{{ iq }}</span>
						<div class="char-steps">
							<button id="char-minus-iq" class="nui-button nui-button--icon nui-anim char-step char-step--minus" data-if="minus_iq"
							        data-event-mousedown="stat_minus('INT', ev.button)" data-event-mouseover="stat_over('minus', 'INT')"
							        data-event-mouseout="stat_out('minus', 'INT')"><span class="nui-glyph nui-glyph--minus"><span
								class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span class="nui-glyph__b"></span></span></button>
							<button id="char-plus-iq" class="nui-button nui-button--icon nui-anim char-step char-step--plus" data-if="plus_iq"
							        data-event-mousedown="stat_plus('INT', ev.button)" data-event-mouseover="stat_over('plus', 'INT')"
							        data-event-mouseout="stat_out('plus', 'INT')"><span class="nui-glyph nui-glyph--plus"><span
								class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span class="nui-glyph__b"></span></span></button>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="char-stat char-stat--st">
						<span class="char-stat__label"><span class="char-ico char-ico--str"></span>@ui.CHARACTER_STR</span>
						<span id="char-value-st" class="char-stat__value">{{ st }}</span>
						<div class="char-steps">
							<button id="char-minus-st" class="nui-button nui-button--icon nui-anim char-step char-step--minus" data-if="minus_st"
							        data-event-mousedown="stat_minus('STR', ev.button)" data-event-mouseover="stat_over('minus', 'STR')"
							        data-event-mouseout="stat_out('minus', 'STR')"><span class="nui-glyph nui-glyph--minus"><span
								class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span class="nui-glyph__b"></span></span></button>
							<button id="char-plus-st" class="nui-button nui-button--icon nui-anim char-step char-step--plus" data-if="plus_st"
							        data-event-mousedown="stat_plus('STR', ev.button)" data-event-mouseover="stat_over('plus', 'STR')"
							        data-event-mouseout="stat_out('plus', 'STR')"><span class="nui-glyph nui-glyph--plus"><span
								class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span class="nui-glyph__b"></span></span></button>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="char-stat char-stat--dx">
						<span class="char-stat__label"><span class="char-ico char-ico--dex"></span>@ui.CHARACTER_DEX</span>
						<span id="char-value-dx" class="char-stat__value">{{ dx }}</span>
						<div class="char-steps">
							<button id="char-minus-dx" class="nui-button nui-button--icon nui-anim char-step char-step--minus" data-if="minus_dx"
							        data-event-mousedown="stat_minus('DEX', ev.button)" data-event-mouseover="stat_over('minus', 'DEX')"
							        data-event-mouseout="stat_out('minus', 'DEX')"><span class="nui-glyph nui-glyph--minus"><span
								class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span class="nui-glyph__b"></span></span></button>
							<button id="char-plus-dx" class="nui-button nui-button--icon nui-anim char-step char-step--plus" data-if="plus_dx"
							        data-event-mousedown="stat_plus('DEX', ev.button)" data-event-mouseover="stat_over('plus', 'DEX')"
							        data-event-mouseout="stat_out('plus', 'DEX')"><span class="nui-glyph nui-glyph--plus"><span
								class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span class="nui-glyph__b"></span></span></button>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="char-stats char-stats--vital">
					<div class="char-stat char-stat--hp"><span class="char-ico char-ico--hp"></span><span
						class="char-stat__label">@ui.CHARACTER_HP</span><span id="char-value-hp" class="char-stat__value">{{ hp }}</span></div>
					<div class="char-stat char-stat--sp"><span class="char-ico char-ico--sp"></span><span
						class="char-stat__label">@ui.CHARACTER_SP</span><span id="char-value-sp" class="char-stat__value">{{ sp }}</span></div>
					<div class="char-stat char-stat--att"><span class="char-ico char-ico--att"></span><span
						class="char-stat__label">@ui.CHARACTER_ATT</span><span id="char-value-att" class="char-stat__value">{{ att }}</span></div>
					<div class="char-stat char-stat--def"><span class="char-ico char-ico--def"></span><span
						class="char-stat__label">@ui.CHARACTER_DEF</span><span id="char-value-def" class="char-stat__value">{{ def }}</span></div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="char-divider char-divider--extra">
				<div class="char-bar"></div>
				<img class="char-art char-art--ext" data-attr-src="art.ext"/>
				<span class="char-divider__label">@ui.CHARACTER_EXTRA_STATS</span>
			</div>
			<div class="char-extra">
				<img class="char-art char-art--ext1" data-attr-src="art.ext_item1"/>
				<img class="char-art char-art--ext2" data-attr-src="art.ext_item2"/>
				<div class="char-stats">
					<div class="char-stat char-stat--mspd"><span class="char-ico char-ico--mspd"></span><span
						class="char-stat__label">@ui.CHARACTER_MOVE_SPEED</span><span id="char-value-mspd" class="char-stat__value">{{ mspd }}</span></div>
					<div class="char-stat char-stat--aspd"><span class="char-ico char-ico--aspd"></span><span
						class="char-stat__label">@ui.CHARACTER_ATTACK_SPEED</span><span id="char-value-aspd" class="char-stat__value">{{ aspd }}</span></div>
					<div class="char-stat char-stat--cspd"><span class="char-ico char-ico--cspd"></span><span
						class="char-stat__label">@ui.CHARACTER_CAST_SPEED</span><span id="char-value-cspd" class="char-stat__value">{{ cspd }}</span></div>
				</div>
				<div class="char-stats char-stats--magic">
					<div class="char-stat char-stat--matt"><span class="char-ico char-ico--matt"></span><span
						class="char-stat__label">@ui.CHARACTER_MAGIC_ATT</span><span id="char-value-matt" class="char-stat__value">{{ matt }}</span></div>
					<div class="char-stat char-stat--mdef"><span class="char-ico char-ico--mdef"></span><span
						class="char-stat__label">@ui.CHARACTER_MAGIC_DEF</span><span id="char-value-mdef" class="char-stat__value">{{ mdef }}</span></div>
					<div class="char-stat char-stat--er"><span class="char-ico char-ico--er"></span><span
						class="char-stat__label">@ui.CHARACTER_EVASION</span><span id="char-value-er" class="char-stat__value">{{ er }}</span></div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<!-- The skill page (uiscript Skill_Page). -->
		<div class="char-panel char-panel--skill" data-for="p : panel_skill">
			<div class="char-divider char-divider--groups">
				<div class="char-bar"></div>
				<div class="char-groups">
					<button class="nui-button nui-button--ghost nui-anim char-group" data-for="g : groups" data-attr-id="'char-group-' + it_index"
					        data-if="g.shown" data-class-char-group--col0="g.col == 0" data-class-char-group--col1="g.col == 1"
					        data-class-char-group--col2="g.col == 2" data-class-is-selected="g.down"
					        data-event-mousedown="group_press(it_index, ev.button)"><span
						class="char-group__label">{{ g.label }}</span></button>
					<span class="char-group-name" data-if="group_name_shown">{{ group_name }}</span>
				</div>
				<div id="char-active-points" class="char-points char-points--active"><img class="char-art char-art--uppt"
					data-attr-src="art.uppt"/><span class="char-points__label">@ui.CHARACTER_POINTS</span><span
					class="char-points__value">{{ active_points }}</span></div>
			</div>
			<!-- The modern looks: each row is one skill, its grade columns left to
			     right, a step arrow after each column but the last, lit after the
			     skill's own column; the two halves split by a rule. A column that
			     is not the skill's grade shows its cover (legacy's disabled
			     cover) as a padlock. -->
			<div class="char-skills-board">
				<div id="char-skills" class="nui-slot-grid char-skills" data-class-nui-attach-right="attach_right">
					<div class="char-skill-place" data-for="c : skills" data-attr-class="'char-skill-place char-skill--' + c.slot">
						<div class="nui-slot nui-anim char-skill" data-attr-id="'char-skill-' + c.slot"
						     data-class-is-empty="c.kind == ''" data-class-is-unavailable="c.unavailable"
						     data-event-mousedown="skill_press(it_index, ev.button)" data-event-mouseup="skill_release(it_index, ev.button)"
						     data-event-dblclick="skill_use(it_index)" data-event-mouseover="skill_over(it_index)"
						     data-event-mouseout="skill_out(it_index)" data-event-nuidrop="skill_drop(it_index)">
							<img class="nui-slot__icon" data-if="c.icon != ''" data-attr-src="c.icon"/>
							<div class="nui-slot__cover" data-if="c.cover"></div>
							<nui-cooldown class="nui-slot__cooldown" data-if="c.cd_end > 0"
								data-attr-start="c.cd_start" data-attr-end="c.cd_end"/>
							<nui-frames class="nui-slot__active" data-if="c.active" count="13" delay="0.0667"/>
							<span class="nui-slot__ring nui-anim nui-fx" data-if="c.active" data-class-is-on="c.active"></span>
							<nui-frames class="nui-slot__finish" data-if="c.cd_end > 0" count="11"
								delay="0.0333" loop="false" after="none" data-attr-start="c.cd_end"/>
							<nui-frames class="nui-slot__flash nui-anim" data-if="c.cd_end > 0" count="11"
								delay="0.0333" loop="false" after="none" data-attr-start="c.cd_end"/>
							<nui-number class="nui-slot__number" data-if="c.count != ''" data-attr-value="c.count"/>
						</div>
						<div class="nui-slot-button nui-anim char-plus" data-if="c.button" data-attr-id="'char-skill-' + c.slot + '-plus'"
						     data-event-mousedown="skill_plus(c.slot, ev.button)" data-event-mouseover="skill_over(it_index)"
						     data-event-mouseout="skill_out(it_index)"><span class="nui-glyph nui-glyph--plus"><span
							class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span class="nui-glyph__b"></span></span></div>
						<span class="char-step-arrow" data-if="c.col &lt; 2" data-class-is-reached="c.kind != '' &amp;&amp; !c.unavailable"
						      data-class-is-idle="c.kind == ''"></span>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="char-skills-split"></div>
			</div>
			<div class="char-divider char-divider--support">
				<div class="char-bar"></div>
				<span class="char-divider__label">@ui.SKILL_SUPPORT_TITLE</span>
				<div class="char-points char-points--support" data-if="support_points_shown"><img class="char-art char-art--uppt"
					data-attr-src="art.uppt"/><span class="char-points__label">@ui.CHARACTER_POINTS</span><span
					class="char-points__value">{{ support_points }}</span></div>
			</div>
			<div id="char-support" class="nui-slot-grid char-support" data-class-nui-attach-right="attach_right"
			     data-class-nui-slot-grid--cols-6="support_cols == 6">
				<div class="char-support-place" data-for="c : support">
					<div class="nui-slot nui-anim char-skill" data-attr-id="'char-support-' + c.slot"
					     data-class-is-empty="c.kind == ''" data-class-is-unavailable="c.unavailable"
					     data-event-mousedown="support_press(it_index, ev.button)" data-event-mouseup="support_release(it_index, ev.button)"
					     data-event-dblclick="support_use(it_index)" data-event-mouseover="support_over(it_index)"
					     data-event-mouseout="support_out(it_index)" data-event-nuidrop="support_drop(it_index)">
						<img class="nui-slot__icon" data-if="c.icon != ''" data-attr-src="c.icon"/>
						<div class="nui-slot__cover" data-if="c.cover"></div>
						<nui-frames class="nui-slot__active" data-if="c.active" count="13" delay="0.0667"/>
						<span class="nui-slot__ring nui-anim nui-fx" data-if="c.active" data-class-is-on="c.active"></span>
						<nui-number class="nui-slot__number" data-if="c.count != ''" data-attr-value="c.count"/>
					</div>
					<div class="nui-slot-button nui-anim char-plus" data-if="c.button" data-attr-id="'char-support-' + c.slot + '-plus'"
					     data-event-mousedown="skill_plus(c.slot, ev.button)" data-event-mouseover="support_over(it_index)"
					     data-event-mouseout="support_out(it_index)"><span class="nui-glyph nui-glyph--plus"><span
						class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span class="nui-glyph__b"></span></span></div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<!-- The emotion page (uiscript Emoticon_Page). -->
		<div class="char-panel char-panel--emoticon" data-for="p : panel_emoticon">
			<div class="char-divider char-divider--solo">
				<div class="char-bar"></div>
				<span class="char-divider__label">@ui.CHARACTER_NORMAL_ACTION</span>
			</div>
			<div id="char-solo" class="nui-slot-grid char-emotes char-emotes--solo"
			     data-class-nui-attach-right="attach_right" data-class-nui-slot-grid--cols-6="emote_cols == 6">
				<div class="nui-slot nui-anim char-emote" data-for="c : solo" data-attr-id="'char-solo-' + c.slot"
				     data-class-is-empty="c.kind == ''"
				     data-event-mousedown="solo_press(it_index, ev.button)" data-event-mouseup="solo_release(it_index, ev.button)"
				     data-event-dblclick="solo_use(it_index)" data-event-mouseover="solo_over(it_index)"
				     data-event-mouseout="solo_out(it_index)" data-event-nuidrop="solo_drop(it_index)">
					<img class="nui-slot__icon" data-if="c.icon != ''" data-attr-src="c.icon"/>
					<div class="nui-slot__cover" data-if="c.cover"></div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="char-divider char-divider--dual">
				<div class="char-bar"></div>
				<span class="char-divider__label">@ui.CHARACTER_MUTUAL_ACTION</span>
			</div>
			<div id="char-dual" class="nui-slot-grid char-emotes char-emotes--dual"
			     data-class-nui-attach-right="attach_right" data-class-nui-slot-grid--cols-6="emote_cols == 6">
				<div class="nui-slot nui-anim char-emote" data-for="c : dual" data-attr-id="'char-dual-' + c.slot"
				     data-class-is-empty="c.kind == ''"
				     data-event-mousedown="dual_press(it_index, ev.button)" data-event-mouseup="dual_release(it_index, ev.button)"
				     data-event-dblclick="dual_use(it_index)" data-event-mouseover="dual_over(it_index)"
				     data-event-mouseout="dual_out(it_index)" data-event-nuidrop="dual_drop(it_index)">
					<img class="nui-slot__icon" data-if="c.icon != ''" data-attr-src="c.icon"/>
					<div class="nui-slot__cover" data-if="c.cover"></div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<!-- The quest page (uiscript Quest_Page). -->
		<div class="char-panel char-panel--quest" data-for="p : panel_quest">
			<div class="char-quests" data-event-mousescroll="quest_scroll(ev.wheel_delta_y)">
				<div id="char-quest-cells" class="nui-slot-grid nui-slot-grid--cols-1 char-quest-cells" data-class-nui-attach-right="attach_right">
					<div class="nui-slot nui-anim char-quest-cell" data-for="c : quest_cells" data-attr-id="'char-quest-' + it_index + '-icon'"
					     data-class-is-empty="c.kind == ''" data-class-char-quest-cell--base="c.base"
					     data-event-mousedown="quest_press(it_index, ev.button)" data-event-mouseover="quest_over(it_index)"
					     data-event-mouseout="quest_out(it_index)">
						<img class="nui-slot__icon" data-if="c.icon != ''" data-attr-src="c.icon"/>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="char-quest-rows">
					<div class="char-quest" data-for="q : quests" data-attr-id="'char-quest-' + it_index" data-class-is-hidden="!q.shown">
						<span class="nui-glyph nui-glyph--chevron-right char-quest__chev"><span class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span
							class="nui-glyph__b"></span></span>
						<span class="char-quest__name">{{ q.name }}</span>
						<!-- The clock line: its mark, then legacy's text or the countdown
						     (is-over once the time is up: the static text or the run's end). -->
						<span class="char-quest__clock" data-attr-id="'char-quest-' + it_index + '-clock'"
						      data-class-is-timed="q.clock_end &gt; 0" data-class-is-over="q.clock_over"><span
							class="nui-glyph nui-glyph--clock char-quest__clock-mark"><span class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span
							class="nui-glyph__b"></span><span class="nui-glyph__c"></span></span><span
							class="char-quest__clock-text" data-if="q.clock_end &lt;= 0">{{ q.clock_text }}</span><nui-countdown
							class="char-quest__countdown" data-if="q.clock_end &gt; 0" format="minsec" minute="@game.QUEST_MIN"
							second="@game.QUEST_SEC" over="@game.QUEST_TIMEOVER" data-attr-prefix="q.clock_prefix"
							data-attr-end="q.clock_end" data-event-countdownend="quest_clock_over(it_index)"/></span>
						<span class="char-quest__counter">{{ q.counter }}</span>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div id="char-quest-scroll" class="char-quest-scroll" data-if="quest_scroll_shown">
					<button id="char-quest-up" class="nui-button nui-button--icon nui-anim char-quest-scroll__up"
					        data-event-mousedown="quest_scroll_press(-1, ev.button)"><span class="nui-glyph nui-glyph--chevron-up"><span
						class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span class="nui-glyph__b"></span></span></button>
					<progress class="nui-gauge nui-gauge--blue char-quest-scroll__track" direction="bottom"
					          data-attr-value="quest_scroll_pos"/>
					<!-- A thumb at the position down its rail (classic: legacy's middle
					     bar; the modern looks: a pill in a slim well, lifted by its own
					     height times the position, so it stays inside the rail). -->
					<div class="char-quest-scroll__rail"><span class="char-quest-scroll__thumb nui-fx"
						data-style---char-quest-thumb="(quest_scroll_pos * 100) + '%'"
						data-style---char-quest-lift="(quest_scroll_pos * -100) + '%'"></span></div>
					<button id="char-quest-down" class="nui-button nui-button--icon nui-anim char-quest-scroll__down"
					        data-event-mousedown="quest_scroll_press(1, ev.button)"><span class="nui-glyph nui-glyph--chevron-down"><span
						class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span class="nui-glyph__b"></span></span></button>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
	<!-- V-2b: the tab strip is a list of one entry while the board shows (tabs_on). -->
	<div class="char-tabs" data-for="w : tabs_on">
		<img class="char-art char-art--tab" data-if="tab == 'STATUS'" data-attr-src="art.tab_1"/>
		<img class="char-art char-art--tab" data-if="tab == 'SKILL'" data-attr-src="art.tab_2"/>
		<img class="char-art char-art--tab" data-if="tab == 'EMOTICON'" data-attr-src="art.tab_3"/>
		<img class="char-art char-art--tab" data-if="tab == 'QUEST'" data-attr-src="art.tab_4"/>
		<button id="char-tab-status" class="nui-button nui-button--ghost nui-anim char-tab char-tab--status" data-class-is-selected="tab == 'STATUS'"
		        data-event-mousedown="tab_press('STATUS', ev.button)"><span class="char-tab__label">@ui.CHARACTER_MAIN</span></button>
		<button id="char-tab-skill" class="nui-button nui-button--ghost nui-anim char-tab char-tab--skill" data-class-is-selected="tab == 'SKILL'"
		        data-event-mousedown="tab_press('SKILL', ev.button)"><span class="char-tab__label">@ui.CHARACTER_SKILL</span></button>
		<button id="char-tab-emoticon" class="nui-button nui-button--ghost nui-anim char-tab char-tab--emoticon" data-class-is-selected="tab == 'EMOTICON'"
		        data-event-mousedown="tab_press('EMOTICON', ev.button)"><span class="char-tab__label">@ui.CHARACTER_ACTION</span></button>
		<button id="char-tab-quest" class="nui-button nui-button--ghost nui-anim char-tab char-tab--quest" data-class-is-selected="tab == 'QUEST'"
		        data-event-mousedown="tab_press('QUEST', ev.button)"><span class="char-tab__label">@ui.CHARACTER_QUEST</span></button>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
